WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Me! I come first! Let me go first!

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:07,410
My shop is one hundred and two big

3
00:00:07,410 --> 00:00:10,410
My shop only costs 800,000!

4
00:00:15,630 --> 00:00:18,300
Brother, I want to sell me too

5
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:20,300
What did you just say about me?

6
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:23,620
20% lower price

7
00:00:23,620 --> 00:00:28,180
Love to sell or not to sell

8
00:00:28,180 --> 00:00:29,180
Not yet?

9
00:00:35,930 --> 00:00:37,930
Boss, I am the dean of Fengren Hospital opposite.

10
00:00:37,930 --> 00:00:42,980
I want to sell 99% of the shares of Fengrenyuan

11
00:00:42,980 --> 00:00:48,510
Oh, why sell Fengrenyuan?

12
00:00:48,510 --> 00:00:49,510
Tell the truth

13
00:00:49,510 --> 00:00:51,510
President Chen, the founder of our institute

14
00:00:51,510 --> 00:00:54,510
I provoked something I shouldn’t have provoked.

15
00:00:54,510 --> 00:00:56,580
After I became the dean on his behalf,

16
00:00:56,580 --> 00:00:58,580
Only then did I realize that I had been tricked

17
00:00:58,580 --> 00:01:01,580
So I want to sell my shares and leave.
